                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("It’s so cold here! And this fog is so thick. This is quite a change from fighting bandits in the farmlands near Westin!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Indeed. Before us lies the Black River — and so too must Mebrin, great sage of the elves. He is here! I feel wisps of his magic reaching out to me from nearby..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Listen well, humans, for the great sage Mebrin is ancient, and has no love for your kind. He personally bore witness to Lich-Lord Jevyan and his terrible invasion, in days back when the land was still young. Should anyone truly understand the undead and how the Urzas learned to summon them, it will be Mebrin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("With the three elder Urza brothers defeated, only the youngest remains to oppose us. Mebrin must be his captive, and these woods must be filled with bandits and undead. Dangerous though the task may be, I promise to help rescue your sage, Ethiliel."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "s04_phase",
            value: "intro",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
