                equals: "elf_alliance",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("This must be the cave the bandit spoke about, but there is no sign of Mebrin. Perhaps Afalas really was lying."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_56_opt0",
