      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_56",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%228%22%2C%22canrecruit%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "variable",
                name: "s04_phase",
                equals: "elf_alliance",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "dialogue",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "message",
                speaker: "Deoran",
                text: _("The ghoul guarding the cave is defeated! I agreed to help Ethiliel bring Urza Afalas to justice, but perhaps there would be merit in venturing further inside..."),
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Continue fighting Urza Afalas"),
                event: "ev_56_opt0",
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Enter the cave"),
                event: "ev_56_opt1",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Deoran, what are you doing? You would abandon our fight and let this criminal walk free!?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "dialogue",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "message",
                speaker: "narrator",
                portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
                text: _("Author’s note — this is a “secret” path, and somewhat more challenging than the regular options. Are you sure you want to proceed?"),
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Continue fighting Urza Afalas"),
                event: "ev_56_opt0",
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Enter the cave"),
                event: "ev_56_opt1",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I’m sorry, Ethiliel, but fighting these bandits doesn’t feel right. My soldiers and I are going to descend down into this cave, to find out the truth for ourselves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("And how shall I defeat Urza Afalas without your help? He will surely escape, free from justice for his foul deeds! Was this your plan all along, to string me along with false promises?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            portrait: "portraits/ethiliel-mad.webp",
            text: _("Humans! All you humans are the same! I should never have expected your kind to help me find Mebrin. Deoran, even your vile conspiracies shall not keep the elves from our greatest sage. Soon all of you humans shall learn that the Aethenwood protects its own!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Ethiliel",
            x: 2,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "stored_ethiliel",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Ethiliel",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Well, that could have gone better... I only hope that we will find the truth of the matter down in these caves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "__next_scenario",
            value: "the-south-guard-05c",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_57",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Afalas%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "variable",
                name: "s04_phase",
                equals: "elf_alliance",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Afalas",
            text: _("You... have doomed us all..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_58",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Afalas%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "variable",
                name: "s04_phase",
                equals: "elf_alliance",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%222%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Justice. Thank you for your aid, Deoran. I know it was hard for you to turn against your own kind — you have earned my respect."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I’ve searched all the tents, but cannot find Mebrin anywhere in the bandit camp. Ethiliel, do you still sense his magic nearby?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Yes I do, and without that distracting criminal on my mind I can feel Mebrin clearer than ever. I sense joy. I sense power... I sense..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("...Humans, we should leave."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("What? But what about rescuing—"),
